  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n6 : 42 :: 9 : ?\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nn × (n + 1)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n6 × (6 + 1) = 6 × 7 = 42\n\n⇒ Pattern = n × (n + 1)\n\n9 × (9 + 1) = 9 × 10\n\n⇒ 90\n\n**∴ Missing number = 90.**",
